WEBVTT

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:05.680
<i>The last day of the U15 
Women's Championship.</i>

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:10.600
<i>After Hole 17, Aoi has a 12 stroke 
lead on her closest opponent.</i>

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.030
<i>She can't lose.</i>

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:18.820
<i>But for the last day, 
Aoi and Eve Aleon are both 10 under.</i>

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.600
<i>Eve Aleon has already finished her game.</i>

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.570
<i>In other words,</i>

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.880
<i>if she can make this birdie on Hole 18,</i>

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:31.630
<i>Aoi will be the winner of their game.</i>

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:51.870
I'll go first.

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.880
Congratulations on your win!

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.880
That was some amazing golf.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.440
Thank you.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:11.880
Aoi!

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:15.120
Aoi, that putt—

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.420
What were you thinking?

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:18.760
What do you mean?

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:22.840
There's no way you could 
miss an easy shot like that!

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:24.100
Why did you let me win?

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:26.860
This was supposed to be a real game!

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:32.310
That was my real shot.

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:46.820
That last shot...

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:49.540
was my mistake.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.430
Sorry.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.510
I didn't mean to ruin your game,

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.010
but I can't let Eve lose her motivation.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.100
She needs it for her next game.

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:25.830
Hey, how long are you 
going to sit there, Eve?

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.100
Eve, we'll be heading back.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:33.670
Okay.

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.210
Sis...

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.330
Just come on!

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:43.980
We couldn't finish our game 
because of my mistake.

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.350
I'm frustrated too.

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.600
So play me again.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.750
What are you saying, Aoi?

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:53.480
It's time for the awards ceremony!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.820
And you're going back to Japan tomorrow!

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.100
I know.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:03.160
So I'll be waiting here, at Hole 1, 
tomorrow at 5 AM.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:08.750
Let's play golf right 
until it's time for my flight.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.280
<i>It's funny...</i>

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:19.480
<i>My life is shit. 
I hated getting up in the morning.</i>

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:22.980
<i>And now I can't wait for tomorrow...</i>

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:32.860
I know it's been a long day, 
but I need you to do a job for me.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:34.230
Now?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:38.690
It's time to repay the favor we did 
by getting you into the tournament.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.440
You really are shit.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.350
Watch your mouth, damn it!

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:45.790
Just drive the car.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.360
R-Right, ma'am!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.790
Vipère

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.600
Wait here.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.830
O-Okay.

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:16.740
Why am I wearing a blindfold?

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:19.540
We can't let you see where we're going.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:22.820
Unless you're willing to join my gang...

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:24.480
No thanks.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.630
I'm sure you know this, but my patron,

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:34.640
Catherine, is the CEO 
of a real estate company.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.290
But she also has secret mafia ties.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.080
And?

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:44.000
She's fighting with another mafia boss over 
the rights to a certain plot of land.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.560
It's about to develop 
into a bloody, all-out war.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.880
And so you want to settle it with golf?

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:50.470
Sounds like something out of a B.D.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:55.350
Everybody's starved 
for some real entertainment.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.320
You can take off the blindfold.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.580
Th-This is...

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:28.930
Welcome to the Catherine Golf Course.

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:31.430
I apologize for our lateness, madame.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.390
It's fine. They're not here yet.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:37.650
Rich people have a lot of money 
to spend on entertainment.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:41.640
Oh, I don't do anything 
that doesn't make me money.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:45.650
I only hire these boys 
because they satisfy me.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.400
The golf course is the same.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:53.160
The club members are from all around the world, 
and they're all obsessed with betting on golf.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:57.640
The rules are set up so that 
the one who makes them,

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:00.620
the "house," makes more 
money than the players.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.160
It's an investment, and a cheap one at that.

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:06.880
So, who do I fight?

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:13.150
Hello. Have I kept you waiting?

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.710
Not at all!

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:20.470
Thank you for coming all 
this way, Mr. Nicolas.

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:23.070
Not at all. Anything for you.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.500
He's my opponent?

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:28.180
Nope. A mafia boss.

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:30.690
Don't piss him off or you'll end up dead.

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:34.950
Let's start by going over the rules.

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:37.870
At stake is the land deed,

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:41.200
as well as rights to control 
the casino built on the land itself.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.850
The winner of the golf match gets both.

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:47.920
One hole. Match play.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.270
If it's a tie, sudden death 
until there's a winner.

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:54.680
The course will be random, naturally,

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.780
to prevent one player 
from having an advantage.

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:00.940
Fine.

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:04.000
So, where is your player?

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.950
She's here, of course.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.040
This is her.

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:22.300
You're familiar with the name Vipère, 
the underground golfer, yes?

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:24.930
V-Vipère?

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:27.340
You mean Vipère the Reaper?

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.780
Yes, yes that's right.

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:32.090
Vipère the Reaper.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:36.840
She wasn't cheap, I'll have you know.

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:39.160
I should've known it would be Vipère.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.010
Hey, if it isn't Rose!

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:44.380
It's been a while.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.770
You're my opponent tonight?

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.100
Fine!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.300
I'll make <i>certain</i> you have a good time!

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:52.080
During the game, and after it!

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.790
Sorry, but it's not me you'll be playing.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.200
It's her.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:03.280
Oh, my. She's so young!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:06.250
Not that we'll show her any 
mercy on account of youth.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:10.030
Scared?

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:11.750
I can understand why.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.430
After all, you're up 
against Vipère the Reaper...

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.750
Who? I've never heard of her.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.610
It's amazing, being young!

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:26.180
You know no fear!

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.310
Let's just start.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:30.630
I've got something to do tomorrow.

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:34.060
This game's a waste of my time, 
and I want to get it over with.

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.920
I like you!

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:39.910
You're wearing way too much perfume.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:41.090
What's your name?

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:43.760
I won't tell you because 
I don't care if you know it.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:48.210
Hey, why don't we raise the stakes?

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:52.450
If I win, I get to have my way 
with you for a full day tomorrow.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:56.490
And if you win, you can do 
whatever you want with me.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:58.130
Perfect.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:00.980
I was hoping I could get 
a driver for the ride home.

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:05.720
I'll spend an entire day making 
sure you never forget my name!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:08.480
Both in your heart, and your body.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.080
Not happening.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:13.240
There's already another name in my heart.

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:16.280
I don't need anybody else's name.

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:20.400
<i>Are you both ready?</i>

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.610
Yes!

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:22.740
Whenever.

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:26.240
All right. I'll randomly generate the course.

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:17.180
<i>How do you like it?</i>

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:21.720
This is the Catherine Golf Course's 
random generation system.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.260
Nouveau riche.

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:26.660
I heard that, girl.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.420
Heads? Tails?

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:32.740
They're both heads.

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:37.180
You first.

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:44.630
That girl's not going to 
screw this up, is she?

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:46.080
Don't worry.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:49.460
I've ensured her motivation is at its peak.

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:01.740
<i>I'll win this hole.</i>

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:03.440
<i>I have to go back...</i>

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:05.400
<i>to fight her!</i>

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.990
<i>Direct strike...</i>

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:09.320
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:18.060
What?

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:25.650
Why? How?

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:29.210
Too bad!

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:37.340
I'm sorry my report is late.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:42.840
I'm sure you saw the news, 
but she won the tournament.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:46.600
Twelve strokes below second place. 
A perfect victory.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.930
Japan Amawashi HQ Building

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.930
Perfect? I don't know about that.

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:54.200
There was a player on the last 
day who had the same score she did.

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:58.640
Why didn't you report that? 
I know you saw it.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:03.160
<i>W-Well... she wasn't 
an official player, so...</i>

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:05.660
She was happy, wasn't she?

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.460
<i>She was happy, wasn't she?</i>

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:08.780
How did you know?

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.950
I can tell.

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.230
I'm her mother.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.480
I can't wait for tomorrow!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.030
<i>Why?</i>

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.200
<i>Why did I miss that shot?</i>

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:41.090
<i>My form was the same as it's been for
tens, hundreds of thousands of strokes.</i>

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.330
<i>The club's fine, too.</i>

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.740
<i>So why?</i>

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:47.140
What's wrong?

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:49.090
Weren't you going to wrap this up fast?

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:50.500
You had something to do, right?

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:57.110
Eve!

00:12:58.480 --> 00:12:59.640
Eve,

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:03.720
every player who's fought her always gets 
thrown off their game for some reason.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.590
She's using some trick. Find it.

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:07.760
Why didn't you tell me before—

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.560
Stop whining and just beat her!

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.560
Isn't there someone waiting for you?

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:17.010
So I'll be waiting at hole 1 
here tomorrow at 5 AM.

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:19.160
You don't need to tell me...

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.780
<i>Eve 2nd shot</i>

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.110
Why did my shot go off course?

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:30.920
I'll start by shooting like I always do, 
and find what feels different!

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.160
Nothing felt different.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.300
<i>Vipère 2nd shot</i>

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.220
<i>Vipère for birdie</i>

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:57.690
<i>Eve for birdie</i>

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:00.660
Make this shot and you win.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:02.640
Yup.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.870
<i>I can't figure out what feels wrong.</i>

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:09.680
<i>Fortunately, it's a straight line.</i>

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.690
<i>I won't use the green bullet.</i>

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:13.650
<i>I'll just get it into the cup...</i>

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.800
<i>I missed at one meter?</i>

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:22.980
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.850
We'll both take a gimmie there, right?

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.760
Let's get started.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:37.510
So close!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.020
<i>No, it wasn't.</i>

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:45.560
<i>When Eve tried for the birdie, 
Vipère wasn't concerned at all.</i>

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:50.060
<i>And he knew Eve would miss, too.</i>

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:53.240
<i>There's some trick! I know it!</i>

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.870
<i>I was able to make the second 
shot on Hole 1 normally.</i>

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:01.300
<i>I'll just do it the same way!</i>

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.960
Looks like it's going to be a long night!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.260
Amane! What do I do?

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:22.480
I'm looking forward to 
tomorrow so much I can't sleep!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.060
Just sleep!

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:37.380
<i>The second hole went 
exactly the same as the first.</i>

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:39.550
<i>My tee shot went 
into the rough on the right.</i>

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:42.060
<i>And then my 2nd shot went right 
where I aimed it onto the green.</i>

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.830
<i>And then I missed the putt.</i>

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:46.880
<i>The 3rd hole is par 3.</i>

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.370
<i>Let's see if the rule is the same...</i>

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:52.340
<i>I'll aim too far to the left!</i>

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:57.230
<i>It's not going to the right?</i>

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:05.910
<i>It went just where it was 
supposed to. But why?</i>

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.570
<i>You're worried, aren't you?</i>

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.500
<i>You're afraid, aren't you?</i>

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:20.700
<i>But you'll never discover my secret.</i>

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.550
<i>Ever!</i>

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:42.520
<i>Eve 2nd shot</i>

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:47.840
<i>This'll be your last shot!</i>

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.640
<i>Then you and I are in for a fun tomorrow!</i>

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:53.660
<i>That's what you get for being so rude to me.</i>

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:58.660
<i>I'll make it so your body 
never wants to leave me again.</i>

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:09.380
Why isn't she taking her shot? 
What's she doing?

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:14.910
She's been in the address 
position for 45 seconds.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:17.330
If she doesn't shoot for a full minute,

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:20.310
per the rules we decided, she'll lose.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.210
Hit the damn ball already!

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.650
It's fine, madame.

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:28.580
She's already loaded her bullet.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:35.200
So I'll be waiting here, at Hole 1, 
tomorrow at 5 AM.

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:40.400
Let's play golf.

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:17.230
Escaping...

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:19.200
Y-Yellow Bullet...

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:22.830
How? How did it go in?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:30.600
I figured out why they call 
you Vipère, the poison snake.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:33.370
You have poison...

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.800
A poison scent.

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:39.740
Every time I missed a shot,

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:42.320
you were always close.

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:46.810
And you'd lowered your zipper 
to your belly button, to spread your scent!

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:52.770
I didn't miss my third shot 
because your zipper was up.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:55.640
You wanted to keep me 
from noticing the pattern.

00:18:55.640 --> 00:19:00.050
That scent threw off my
sense of balance ever so slightly!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:05.040
But that tiny distortion 
is fatal to a golfer.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.670
<i>I discovered your trick.</i>

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.720
<i>I won't fall for the same trap again.</i>

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.890
<i>I win!</i>

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.860
Impossible!

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:33.240
I can't lose to a little girl like this!

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:37.730
Don't just stand there!

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.350
Keep your promise!

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:46.530
You're late—

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:52.160
Wh-What?!

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:57.090
Can't you go faster?

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.590
No! This is a classic car!

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:01.310
Just hurry!

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:03.260
Stop it! This thing's expensive!

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:07.060
Get me to the Nafrece 
Golf Course! By 5 AM!

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.360
The Nafrece Golf Course?

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:12.960
That's 4 hours away 
no matter how fast we go!

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.060
What time is it?

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.520
3 AM!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:16.770
Hurry!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:20.320
I can't go any faster!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.240
Isn't it about time to give up?

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:37.290
Sorry! Just 10 more minutes!

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:40.250
No, just five minutes!

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:44.720
Five. I'll go check out.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.540
Thanks. And sorry.

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:54.050
Where's the parking lot?

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.920
Head straight for Hole 1!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:11.330
What do I do if they call the cops?

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:12.640
Let them arrest you!

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:14.070
That's so mean!

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:44.230
<i>The plane will take off shortly.</i>

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:51.820
Eve?

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:55.000
That's Eve!

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.870
Eve! Eve!

00:21:56.870 --> 00:21:58.330
Aoi, calm down!

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:01.980
Liar!

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:03.040
Aoi!

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:04.590
Liar!

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:12.080
Liar!

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:49.980
Next Episode

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:42.990
I'm Amane Shinjo, Aoi's caddy.

00:23:42.990 --> 00:23:46.740
Aoi's having a VR golf game 
with Eve without telling me?

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:50.000
At such a crucial time?!
